# Normalise line endings on checkin. A Windows round trip previously flipped
# the whole tree LF -> CRLF (43,417 insertions / 43,417 deletions, with
# `git diff --ignore-all-space` empty) and left UTF-8 BOMs and cp1252-misread
# mojibake behind. This keeps the repository LF-only regardless of platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.db binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.node binary
